WEBVTT

00:00:03.230 --> 00:00:06.440
My name is Tetsunosuke Sasaki 
who silences crying babies.

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:09.360
When I make curry, I add pickles, aye.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.050
If someone looks evil, 
he's a buddy of mine.

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:14.890
We always wake up with some morning pine.

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:17.800
This is Isaburo Sasaki, my bro.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:20.500
Head of the Mimawarigumi and always 
lookin' for a fightin' foe.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:23.350
Here's Toshiro Hijikata, the boss guy.

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:26.290
A lot went down, but now, we fly?

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:35.920
I walk my life on the pedestrian road.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:40.560
Got a heart of steel that will never blow.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:46.270
Kou Shibasaki is my type of ho.

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:51.550
And that's the end of this recap, yo.

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:57.570
How the hell was that a recap?!

00:00:57.950 --> 00:00:59.160
Yeah.

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:45.920
<b>Thorny and Rosy</b>

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:06.510
Welcome back, big guy.

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:11.820
That was mean of you.

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:15.070
I helped free you.

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:21.040
Oh, really?

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:24.750
But it's your fault I was 
arrested in the first place.

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:31.730
You should blame Hijikata-san 
and the rich dumbass.

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:33.660
I didn't do anything wrong.

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:37.640
Yeah, neither did I.

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:50.660
Please do not blame the Shinsengumi.

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.910
It was entirely our fault.

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.390
I must apologize.

00:03:57.390 --> 00:04:00.360
I did not realize he 
was a friend of yours.

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:04.170
I am unable to properly 
express my remorse,

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:06.370
so could you please give 
me your e-mail address?

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:09.470
I will send a message of apology.

00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:15.760
It's Die_Elite@bocomo.ne.jp.

00:04:15.760 --> 00:04:19.850
However, my nose is supposed 
to be as sharp as a Doberman's.

00:04:19.850 --> 00:04:24.020
And I could smell great wrongdoing 
coming from your body.

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:24.770
Hm?

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:27.440
<b>The Perfect Happiness Theory
The Joi Patriot Happiness Doctrine</b>

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:27.440
-Oh? It took me to an odd site...

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:27.440
-What? I smell?

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:28.820
It's been two days since I washed it,

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:31.200
but I only wore it when I went 
to the convenience store.

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:32.350
It should be okay.

00:04:32.350 --> 00:04:34.140
Am I okay, Okita-kun?

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:39.530
Well, this person isn't exactly 
an innocent bystander.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:43.410
If you round to the nearest 
degree, he's a criminal.

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:45.840
Don't make it sound so bad.

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:49.510
If you start rounding, everyone's 
a criminal, you fool.

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:54.430
<b>5:00 Wake up! Borrow milk from a neighbor. Find something to eat for breakfast. Yummy
6:00-6:30 Radio exercise. Grab extra snacks.
7:00-7:30 Kidnap a cucumber and waterboard it!!</b>

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:53.870
Kids spend their entire summer 
vacation committing crimes,

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:56.860
except when they're exercising, you fool.

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:57.180
<b>8:00-9:45 Kid Summer Specials. Salt in old wounds. Lame
10:00-11:45 Pee in the pool, and visit the girls' locker room. Titter.
Eat ramen, then run out of the store.</b>

00:04:57.180 --> 00:04:59.340
We are willing to compensate you for

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:01.060
your damaged scooter or any trauma,

00:05:01.060 --> 00:05:03.610
so please indicate your desired amount

00:05:03.180 --> 00:05:05.940
<b>Weekday Sale</b>

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.940
on the back of this flyer.

00:05:06.210 --> 00:05:09.440
I don't want you pestering us later.

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:11.710
Back of the flyer?!

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:14.210
Don't look down on us common 
folk, you elite prick!

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:17.820
You think that's enough to 
soothe the wounds to my heart?!

00:05:18.780 --> 00:05:20.520
Mind if I use toilet paper?

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:22.330
I need more room to work with.

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:25.420
Big guy, you're wasting your time.

00:05:25.410 --> 00:05:27.710
They'll just flush it down the toilet.

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:29.880
Please carry on.

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:34.160
I appreciate this, Sasaki-dono.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:36.120
Hey! What are you doing?!

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:41.530
Our vice chief screwed up, 
so I guess we're even now.

00:05:41.530 --> 00:05:44.610
That's bullshit! How did 
I get dragged into this?!

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:47.850
No, we're already asking you to

00:05:47.850 --> 00:05:50.400
dispose of the trash that is my brother.

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:53.980
Though I'm willing to pay extra.

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:56.490
We'll dispose of our own trash.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.130
Yeah, you fool!

00:05:58.130 --> 00:06:00.020
Let this guy handle it!

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:01.990
Don't call me trash, you fool!

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:05.740
Nah, he knows that you're 
too much to handle.

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:09.810
You realize that you're supposed 
to separate your trash?

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:15.530
Your non-combustible garbage

00:06:17.790 --> 00:06:20.530
turned out to be pretty burnable.

00:06:21.250 --> 00:06:24.990
It started a fire that's making 
us sweat in the middle of winter.

00:06:24.990 --> 00:06:27.600
Well, he won't be very useful,

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:30.100
but we'll use him until he's 
reduced to a pile of ashes.

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:33.470
Oh, throw that away for me.

00:06:33.470 --> 00:06:37.020
Okita-san, I have a warning for you.

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:41.040
Rotten trash can never be restored.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:43.410
Instead, it spreads contagions

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:46.410
which causes everything around to rot.

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:49.560
You should dispose of it before the

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:51.580
Shinsengumi are infected.

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:54.250
Let's go, big guy.

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:56.050
I'm not going with you!

00:06:56.050 --> 00:06:58.370
Give me back my ten million!

00:06:58.370 --> 00:07:00.190
Hundred million, billion...

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:01.680
Huh? How many zeros were there?

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:04.600
Are you really so desperate for money?

00:07:04.810 --> 00:07:06.180
Hell yeah!

00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:07.610
Unlike you rich people,

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:09.890
we can barely scrape by day to day!

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:12.940
Then I have a job offer for you.

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:20.650
Man, you're pathetic.

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:25.170
At this rate, you won't 
last a day against the Joi.

00:07:27.020 --> 00:07:29.670
If you don't want to die, 
you have to become stronger.

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:31.960
Give me three thousand 
swings before dinner.

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:34.570
V-Vice Chief...

00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:38.960
I-I will become stronger.

00:07:39.630 --> 00:07:45.450
S-Stronger than my brother, 
stronger than you!

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:48.590
I'll never stop in my tracks again.

00:07:48.590 --> 00:07:51.340
I'm gonna catch up to everyone else.

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:53.780
Walk the same path...

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:57.940
S-So you can also become stronger!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:08:03.110
Your brother doesn't hate you.

00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:08.560
I'm sure that he misses you!

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:15.630
After all, you did everything you 
could to protect your brother!

00:08:15.630 --> 00:08:20.530
Your brother did everything 
he could to protect you!

00:08:20.530 --> 00:08:23.060
The two of you are true brothers!

00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:25.960
I envy you.

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:30.520
So please don't run 
away from your brother!

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:34.440
Aren't you known as Thorny Toshi?!

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:44.710
Man, which idiot opened his fat mouth?

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:45.640
Listen up.

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:47.910
You mention that name around me again,

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:51.730
and I'll kill you by cramming 
mayonnaise in every orifice.

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:03.670
<b>Special Police
Shinsengumi</b>

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:03.670
Excuse me!

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:04.960
Vice Chief!

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:09.030
I bought you a yakisoba sandwich!

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:11.680
No thanks!

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:13.750
And I didn't even ask for a sandwich!

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:15.520
You have the instincts of a doormat!

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:17.580
Vice Chief, let me give you a back rub!

00:09:17.580 --> 00:09:18.610
No thanks.

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:20.820
Vice Chief, need me to 
buy you more cigarettes?

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:21.750
No thanks.

00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:23.900
Vice Chief, shall I 
clean your room for you?

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:25.820
Just cut it out already!

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:28.030
Vice Chief, I brought you mayonnaise.

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:30.490
Thank you. That's enough, so go away.

00:09:30.490 --> 00:09:32.660
Vice Chief, are you hard?

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:35.250
I said to go away!

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:38.320
Just do as you're told.

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:39.000
Don't be a pain in the ass.

00:09:39.550 --> 00:09:41.190
I'm so sorry!

00:09:41.190 --> 00:09:44.120
I wanted to make myself useful!

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:46.720
I can't get any work done 
if you keep bugging me.

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:47.600
Forget it.

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:49.390
Go deliver this for me.

00:09:49.890 --> 00:09:51.880
And take your time.

00:09:53.420 --> 00:09:56.270
Vice Chief, is this letter for...?

00:09:56.270 --> 00:09:58.600
You're going to become stronger than me?

00:09:58.600 --> 00:10:00.110
Then show me what you're made of.

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:06.280
<b>Tamegoro Hijikata</b>

00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:09.280
Y-Yes, sir...

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:12.650
I promise to deliver!

00:10:21.730 --> 00:10:23.300
Found him.

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:29.770
The target is alone.

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:31.770
Now's our chance to take him.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:33.560
He's headed your way.

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:35.360
Everyone ready?

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:37.350
Don't let that traitor get away.

00:10:38.560 --> 00:10:40.850
Hey, newbie. He's coming our way.

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:43.860
Don't let him out of your sight.

00:10:44.150 --> 00:10:45.860
Hey, did you hear me?

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:48.100
Huh? Oh.

00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:50.060
Aye, aye, sir.

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:52.760
Can we trust him?

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:54.210
He isn't taking this seriously.

00:10:56.450 --> 00:11:01.380
<b>From: Sabu-chan</b>

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:58.380
Good work.

00:10:58.380 --> 00:10:59.930
How is everything going?

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:01.380
Drop me a message every now and then.

00:11:02.150 --> 00:11:04.210
What? You want me to go undercover?

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:07.280
Yes. You see, the 
Mimawarigumi is currently

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:09.220
pursuing a certain organization.

00:11:09.220 --> 00:11:13.220
I need you to infiltrate them 
and provide us with information.

00:11:13.220 --> 00:11:15.010
Which organization are you talking about?

00:11:15.010 --> 00:11:17.890
I'd be up for infiltrating AKB.

00:11:17.890 --> 00:11:19.730
I'll investigate their BWHs.

00:11:20.140 --> 00:11:22.640
It's probably the Joi, spelled JOY.

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:24.560
Ponytail and Shoo-Shoo, right?

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:26.360
That's some Heavy Low Tension.

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:29.600
As you already know, we are 
elite cops by the elite,

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:32.120
for the elite, and of the elite.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:34.950
If one of our elite members were 
to attempt to infiltrate the Joi,

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:37.370
they would immediately 
notice our eliteness.

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:39.720
Don't you ever get sick of saying elite?

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:41.910
Do you ever get sick of saying

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:44.610
that AKB's Tomomi Itano is cute?

00:11:44.610 --> 00:11:46.960
That metaphor wasn't very elite.

00:11:47.170 --> 00:11:49.670
However, a nasty fellow like you 
would have no trouble taking

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:51.600
center stage with JOY and

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:53.840
becoming their number one terrorist.

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:55.340
That wouldn't make me happy.

00:11:55.340 --> 00:11:57.100
I'd be arrested on the spot.

00:11:58.170 --> 00:11:59.850
Our target is the Check It Out gang.

00:12:01.190 --> 00:12:03.180
They used to be a bunch of thug

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:05.570
s who dissed the Bakufu 
with their rapping,

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:08.900
but after continued internal 
strife and expansion,

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:11.310
they transformed into a 
group of radical rebels.

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:14.380
The gang is now using violence.

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:17.870
We have reports that they are planning

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:17.370
<b>Check It Out Gang</b>

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:20.600
a large-scale terrorist attack.

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:23.910
Your mission is to make contact

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:26.850
and determine the time 
and place of this attack,

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:29.330
as well as locate their 
base of operations.

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:32.170
It will be a dangerous mission,

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:36.040
but if you complete it, we 
will buy millions of your CDs.

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:40.520
I promise that you will place 
first in the next poll.

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:43.270
I let him fool me into this mess,

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:47.010
and they already want me 
to start committing crimes.

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:49.400
Good thing I didn't bring 
Shinpachi and Kagura.

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:52.450
I don't care if they want 
revenge on a traitor,

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:55.410
but that cop better take responsibility.

00:12:55.430 --> 00:12:58.130
They'll get suspicious 
if I make a fuss now.

00:12:58.130 --> 00:12:59.380
Guess I don't have a choice.

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:07.880
<b>From: Sabu-chan
You have a new message.
Urgent.</b>

00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:02.960
What? It's him again?

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:04.040
He's such a pest.

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:06.270
I don't have time to deal with him.

00:13:06.270 --> 00:13:07.950
Huh? Urgent?

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:09.110
Did something happen?

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:11.750
One of my men, Nobutasu, brought these.

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:12.850
So yummy.

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:15.320
If you don't hurry back, there 
won't be any left for you, Gin-tan.

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:17.120
P.S. If you want some, send me a message.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:25.480
Just kidding.

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:28.110
We saved some for you, so work hard.

00:13:28.110 --> 00:13:29.950
I bought a good luck 
charm to keep you safe.

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:32.690
P.S. I'm worried about your 
safety. Please send me a message.

00:13:39.390 --> 00:13:41.880
I made a teru teru bozu 
so it wouldn't rain.

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:44.440
P.S. What's the weather like where 
you are? Please send me a message.

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:53.090
I'm praying for you to send me a message.

00:13:53.090 --> 00:13:55.870
P.S. Rabbits can die of loneliness.

00:13:58.340 --> 00:14:00.050
Friggin' pain in the ass!

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:02.820
He really wants me to send a message!

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:04.240
Damn cell phone addict!

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:06.550
He's as bad as Shoko-tan!

00:14:06.550 --> 00:14:08.440
I don't have time to send you messages!

00:14:08.900 --> 00:14:10.940
Hey, what are you yelling 
about? Calm down!

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:17.050
And why is he so hyper when 
he's sending messages?

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:18.150
He's a different person 
when writing messages?

00:14:18.150 --> 00:14:19.420
I'm working here!

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:20.260
Don't interfere!

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:20.950
Huh?

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:25.950
It's a waste of time to destroy the phone.

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:28.960
It's a waste of time to be so prepared!

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:31.850
Can you stop interfering already?!

00:14:32.380 --> 00:14:34.420
I'm not interfering.

00:14:34.420 --> 00:14:37.720
I'm calling to let you know 
that our target is almost here.

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:39.350
Target?

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:42.430
Please. Don't dawdle or he'll get away.

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:45.470
<b>Tamegoro Hijikata</b>

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:46.800
The vice chief trusted me to 
deliver this important letter.

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:50.300
I-I will become stronger...

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:55.730
S-Stronger than my brother, 
stronger than you!

00:14:55.730 --> 00:14:59.740
He wrote a letter to help encourage me!

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:02.490
Then show me what you're made of.

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:06.830
He was letting me know that 
it was my turn to shine!

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:11.500
Vice Chief, I promise 
to deliver this letter!

00:15:11.500 --> 00:15:14.500
I promise to become stronger 
than everyone else!

00:15:14.500 --> 00:15:18.300
<b>Special Police
Shinsengumi</b>

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:17.460
I will catch up to you guys!

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:22.530
Does he even know where to find a mailbox?

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:25.820
Don't worry.

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:27.810
Your message was delivered.

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:31.360
Your message got to him.

00:15:32.860 --> 00:15:34.450
He'll be...

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:37.590
Tetsu will be fine now.

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:46.470
You out on an errand, Tetsunosuke-kun?

00:15:46.470 --> 00:15:48.900
You used to be one of us, Tetsu.

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:52.520
We all dissed the Bakufu together,

00:15:52.520 --> 00:15:54.950
and now you're one of its dogs.

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:57.830
You've really fallen, traitor!

00:16:33.410 --> 00:16:36.920
Well met. It appears we have 
a problem on our hands.

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:39.890
Who would have thought 
that we would have to

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:41.920
come out here for the 
sake of that failure?

00:16:42.220 --> 00:16:47.430
Did you know about his connection 
to the Joi patriots?

00:16:47.430 --> 00:16:49.200
It appears that he concealed his identity

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:51.200
and met with them from time to time.

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:54.440
A fitting place to go for 
someone with nowhere to belong.

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:59.070
I believe that their leader, 
Eni Men, was quite fond of him,

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:01.270
or fond of his money, I should say.

00:17:01.940 --> 00:17:03.860
But as the gang grew violent,

00:17:03.860 --> 00:17:06.230
he feared that they would learn he was

00:17:06.230 --> 00:17:08.880
the brother of a cop, so he ran away.

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:13.460
In the end, there was 
nowhere for him to go.

00:17:13.460 --> 00:17:15.040
And in the end,

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:18.190
his identity was revealed 
in the worst possible way.

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:20.460
The younger brother of 
the Mimawarigumi chief

00:17:20.460 --> 00:17:23.560
and the assistant to the 
Shinsengumi vice chief.

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:28.010
This information would 
be enough to crush two

00:17:28.010 --> 00:17:30.050
of Edo's strongest police forces.

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:33.150
A rather disparate trade.

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:35.120
To think that fool would hold as

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:38.850
much worth as the leaders of the 
Shinsengumi and Mimawarigumi?

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:42.000
Onward, men.

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:43.910
We need not concern ourselves 
with the hostage.

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:46.820
Wipe out the Joi.

00:17:46.820 --> 00:17:48.710
W-Wait, Sasaki-dono!

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:50.740
You're going to let your brother die?!

00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:53.300
Are you telling me to negotiate 
with the terrorists?

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:57.660
Unfortunately, my life is 
worth far more than yours.

00:17:57.660 --> 00:17:59.720
As I said before,

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:03.450
rotten trash causes everything 
around it to rot.

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:08.240
This would never have 
happened if you had disposed

00:18:08.240 --> 00:18:10.470
of Tetsunosuke as I advised.

00:18:12.470 --> 00:18:14.390
Please get out of the way.

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:17.660
You should be more worried 
about yourselves.

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:20.220
After accepting a former 
Joi as an assistant and

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:22.410
allowing him to be taken hostage,

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:25.100
you have disgraced yourselves.

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.610
If you also allow a son 
of the Sasaki family

00:18:27.610 --> 00:18:29.220
to die in your care,

00:18:29.220 --> 00:18:31.990
how can you ever make amends?

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:35.000
As a fan, I'm eager to see what you do.

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:39.000
Bastard... You used him as a pawn.

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:41.470
So you were trying to eliminate two thorns

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:43.270
in your side at the same time.

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:44.000
Stop it, Toshi!

00:18:44.000 --> 00:18:46.260
You knew this would happen,

00:18:46.260 --> 00:18:49.040
yet you're blaming it all on us.

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:50.650
Gonna pat yourself on the back for getting

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:52.260
rid of us, along with your brother?

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:55.410
You have it all wrong.

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:58.320
I already said that I am a big fan.

00:18:58.320 --> 00:19:01.490
But there are many incompetents who do not

00:19:01.490 --> 00:19:04.780
know how to handle people like you.

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:06.950
You must realize that we are nothing more

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:08.880
than cogs in a larger machine.

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:09.960
What about me?

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:11.780
I understand that I am

00:19:11.780 --> 00:19:16.790
nothing more than a 
large and superior cog.

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:19.640
You can spend the rest of your 
life blaming other people!

00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:21.130
Toshi!

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:27.380
If you seek my head, it'll cost 
you a few heads of your own.

00:19:33.850 --> 00:19:34.930
Go ahead and draw your sword.

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:37.930
I'll jam it right up your ***.

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:42.930
S-Stop this, Toshi, Sogo!

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:44.560
Calm down!

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:47.440
We don't have time for this!

00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:53.620
Conflict! War! What is it good for?

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:56.630
Boys! These cops are about 
to tear into each other!

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:59.990
Watch closely!

00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:03.650
This should be quite the show!

00:20:03.650 --> 00:20:05.630
Mic check, one, two.

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:06.970
Hurry up and do it!

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:08.230
Clap your hands!

00:20:08.230 --> 00:20:09.710
Party hard!

00:20:09.710 --> 00:20:11.040
Arms in the air!

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:14.920
If you keep me waiting, 
my hand might slip!

00:20:14.920 --> 00:20:16.640
Check it out! Check it out! Check it out!

00:20:18.970 --> 00:20:20.020
Toshi!

00:20:23.190 --> 00:20:25.300
Have you lost your mind, Hijikata-san?

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:27.020
Move out of the way.

00:20:33.810 --> 00:20:36.630
I will become stronger.

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:38.660
I'm gonna catch up to everyone else.

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:40.790
Walk the same path...

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:43.580
I don't want to listen to those fools,

00:20:43.580 --> 00:20:46.790
but I can't let you pass either.

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:51.300
This is our battle.

00:20:51.650 --> 00:20:54.940
We're ready to cut our way 
through the bramble to get in.

00:20:54.940 --> 00:20:57.350
Cut our way through the 
bramble to go home,

00:20:57.930 --> 00:21:01.810
bringing him and the 
other Thornies with us.

00:21:01.810 --> 00:21:06.400
We won't let anyone through if 
they don't have what it takes.

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:13.590
It won't be easy to get 
through these thorns.

00:21:14.890 --> 00:21:16.370
I see.

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:21.370
While you delay us and 
draw away their attention,

00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:25.160
a small force will circle 
around and rescue Tetsunosuke.

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:26.890
Is that the plan?

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:29.720
But I also sent someone from our side.

00:21:29.720 --> 00:21:32.280
I hope she can help.

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:37.230
Nobume is an elite assassin 
from our killing squad.

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:39.560
But once her switch is turned on,

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:42.590
she doesn't stop until she's 
killed everyone in the vicinity,

00:21:42.590 --> 00:21:44.330
so I'm worried that she might

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:47.280
harm the hostage and the rest of you.

00:21:47.900 --> 00:21:49.840
Enough chitchat.

00:21:49.840 --> 00:21:52.400
I can't stand the sight of your face.

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:55.900
We both have an excuse to 
eliminate the other now.

00:21:55.900 --> 00:21:56.910
You should be happy.

00:21:57.190 --> 00:22:01.410
I believe that you look like 
anything but a cop right now.

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:03.670
Right back at you.

00:22:04.830 --> 00:22:07.030
-Evil bastard.
-Evil bastard.

00:22:08.040 --> 00:22:09.920
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:40.470 --> 00:23:42.890
<b>Hovering on</b>

00:23:41.300 --> 00:23:42.890
<b>the verge of death...</b>

00:23:42.890 --> 00:23:44.930
<b>Festival of Thornies</b>

00:23:44.930 --> 00:23:49.890
<b>Demon vs. Monster. Hijikata 
vs. Isaburo. Okita vs. Nobume.</b>

00:23:49.890 --> 00:23:54.940
<b>Shinsengumi! Mimawarigumi! Check It Out 
Gang! It's all-out war between bad boys!!</b>
